# Bare domain -> www, keeping the path and query string (301 = permanent).
# One block per website. The domain must also be added in Netlify (Domain management -> Add domain alias),
# and at the DNS provider: A record @ -> 75.2.60.5
#
# Format:  https://example.com/*  https://www.example.com/:splat  301!

# --- tonilocopizza.com ---
http://tonilocopizza.com/*      https://www.tonilocopizza.com/:splat   301!
https://tonilocopizza.com/*     https://www.tonilocopizza.com/:splat   301!
